<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1638091637"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:06.015"><div begin="0.868" end="10.827" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="0.868" end="5.529" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.868" end="3.465">在你眼中看到了</span><span begin="3.465" end="3.986">夏</span><span begin="3.986" end="5.529">天</span></p><p begin="6.728" end="10.827" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.728" end="9.224">再拥抱你身上的</span><span begin="9.224" end="9.642">气</span><span begin="9.642" end="10.827">味</span></p></div><div begin="13.559" end="25.605" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.559" end="16.377" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.559" end="15.904">我牵着你 闲晃在还没塞满人的</span><span begin="15.904" end="16.377">街</span></p><p begin="16.504" end="19.230" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.504" end="18.808">我们踩着昨天随意放在门口的</span><span begin="18.808" end="19.230">鞋</span></p><p begin="19.434" end="21.187" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.434" end="20.879">欧兜迈停得还不够</span><span begin="20.879" end="21.187">远</span></p><p begin="21.317" end="25.605" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.317" end="21.519">这</span><span begin="21.519" end="22.057">点</span><span begin="22.057" end="22.396">时</span><span begin="22.396" end="22.822">间</span> <span begin="22.822" end="23.776">想要跟你一</span><span begin="23.776" end="24.503">起浪</span><span begin="24.503" end="25.605">费</span></p></div><div begin="25.976" end="36.978" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="25.976" end="28.470" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.976" end="26.166">雨</span><span begin="26.166" end="26.749">点</span><span begin="26.749" end="27.737">没有机</span><span begin="27.737" end="28.470">会</span></p><p begin="28.837" end="31.018" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.837" end="29.093">欲</span><span begin="29.093" end="30.643">言又止在嘴</span><span begin="30.643" end="31.018">边</span></p><p begin="31.058" end="33.850" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.058" end="33.473">我的裙摆有一点坚持原则的服</span><span begin="33.473" end="33.850">贴</span></p><p begin="34.040" end="36.978" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.040" end="36.392">那到底是哪双手放在你的腰际</span><span begin="36.392" end="36.978">线</span></p></div><div begin="37.018" end="48.713" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.018" end="42.543" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="37.018" end="37.495">今</span><span begin="37.495" end="41.313">天阳光就是特别耀眼 特别</span><span begin="41.313" end="41.837">和</span><span begin="41.837" end="42.543">谐</span></p><p begin="42.931" end="48.713" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.931" end="43.598">今天</span><span begin="43.598" end="47.232">阳光就是特别耀眼 特别</span><span begin="47.232" end="47.814">和</span><span begin="47.814" end="48.713">谐</span></p></div><div begin="47.661" end="1:23.767" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="47.661" end="52.532" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="47.661" end="50.258">在你眼中看到了</span><span begin="50.258" end="50.779">夏</span><span begin="50.779" end="52.532">天</span></p><p begin="53.546" end="57.985" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="53.546" end="56.042">再拥抱你身上的</span><span begin="56.042" end="56.460">气</span><span begin="56.460" end="57.985">味</span></p><p begin="59.381" end="1:04.582" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="59.381" end="1:01.978">最刚好就在你的</span><span begin="1:01.978" end="1:02.611">身</span><span begin="1:02.611" end="1:04.582">边</span></p><p begin="1:05.259" end="1:10.532" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:05.259" end="1:07.887">在笑声中找不到</span><span begin="1:07.887" end="1:08.415">结</span><span begin="1:08.415" end="1:10.532">尾</span></p><p begin="1:11.834" end="1:17.191" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.834" end="1:13.233">Oh</span> <span begin="1:13.233" end="1:15.698">我怎么会不知道</span> <span begin="1:15.698" end="1:16.456">回不到</span><span begin="1:16.456" end="1:16.834">过</span><span begin="1:16.834" end="1:17.191">去</span></p><p begin="1:17.201" end="1:20.190" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:17.201" end="1:17.833">那是</span><span begin="1:17.833" end="1:18.310">你</span> <span begin="1:18.310" end="1:19.005">那是</span><span begin="1:19.005" end="1:19.429">一</span><span begin="1:19.429" end="1:19.832">期一</span><span begin="1:19.832" end="1:20.190">会</span></p><p begin="1:22.384" end="1:23.767" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:22.384" end="1:23.066">我想</span><span begin="1:23.066" end="1:23.767">念</span></p></div><div begin="1:23.897" end="1:36.470" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:23.897" end="1:29.325" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.897" end="1:24.564">今天</span><span begin="1:24.564" end="1:28.198">阳光就是特别耀眼 特别</span><span begin="1:28.198" end="1:28.780">和</span><span begin="1:28.780" end="1:29.325">谐</span></p><p begin="1:29.675" end="1:36.470" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:29.675" end="1:30.176">今</span><span begin="1:30.176" end="1:30.443">天</span><span begin="1:30.443" end="1:34.037">阳光就是特别耀眼 特别</span><span begin="1:34.037" end="1:34.498">和</span><span begin="1:34.498" end="1:36.470">谐</span></p></div><div begin="1:34.466" end="1:57.287" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="1:34.466" end="1:39.347" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:34.466" end="1:37.063">在你眼中看到了</span><span begin="1:37.063" end="1:37.584">夏</span><span begin="1:37.584" end="1:39.347">天</span></p><p begin="1:40.392" end="1:44.831" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:40.392" end="1:42.888">再拥抱你身上的</span><span begin="1:42.888" end="1:43.306">气</span><span begin="1:43.306" end="1:44.831">味</span></p><p begin="1:46.156" end="1:51.097" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:46.156" end="1:48.753">最刚好就在你的</span><span begin="1:48.753" end="1:49.386">身</span><span begin="1:49.386" end="1:51.097">边</span></p><p begin="1:52.054" end="1:57.287" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:52.054" end="1:54.682">在笑声中找不到</span><span begin="1:54.682" end="1:55.210">结</span><span begin="1:55.210" end="1:57.287">尾</span></p></div><div begin="2:10.686" end="2:23.800" itunes:songPart="PreChorus" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="2:10.686" end="2:16.338" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:10.686" end="2:11.394">今天</span><span begin="2:11.394" end="2:15.085">阳光就是特别耀眼 特别</span><span begin="2:15.085" end="2:15.612">和</span><span begin="2:15.612" end="2:16.338">谐</span></p><p begin="2:16.588" end="2:23.800" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:16.588" end="2:17.226">今天</span><span begin="2:17.226" end="2:20.889">阳光就是特别耀眼 特别</span><span begin="2:20.889" end="2:21.471">和</span><span begin="2:21.471" end="2:23.800">谐</span></p></div><div begin="2:21.360" end="2:44.309" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="2:21.360" end="2:25.589" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:21.360" end="2:23.981">在每个晴天我会</span><span begin="2:23.981" end="2:24.483">想</span><span begin="2:24.483" end="2:25.589">念</span></p><p begin="2:27.258" end="2:32.329" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:27.258" end="2:30.150">我们的快乐铺满了</span><span begin="2:30.150" end="2:32.329">街</span></p><p begin="2:32.977" end="2:38.323" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:32.977" end="2:35.353">后来又经过很</span><span begin="2:35.353" end="2:36.033">多</span><span begin="2:36.033" end="2:36.787">夏</span><span begin="2:36.787" end="2:38.323">天</span></p><p begin="2:38.851" end="2:44.309" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.851" end="2:41.473">我还是踩着那一</span><span begin="2:41.473" end="2:42.138">双</span><span begin="2:42.138" end="2:44.309">鞋</span></p></div></body></tt>